=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Despachiaire} (K-10 Upper Level) behind the Walnut Door at (K-9) to start the quest.
** You may have to talk to him twice if you haven't started the quest {q:Tango with a Tracker|Tango with a Tracker|Tango with a Tracker}.
* Talk to {n:Parelbriaux}. (K-7 Upper Level)
* Talk to {n:Odeya}. (J-10 Upper Level)
* Obtain a {@i:Tavnazian Liver|5154} {i:Tavnazian Liver|Tavnazian Liver|5154} from the {m:Orcs|Orc} in {z:Lufaise Meadows} or the {m:Tavnazian Sheep} in {z:Lufaise Meadows} or {z:Misareaux Coast}.
* Return to {z:Tavnazian Safehold} and trade the {i:Tavnazian Liver|Tavnazian Liver|5154} to {n:Odeya}.
* Proceed to {z:Phomiuna Aqueducts}:

:* Map 1: Climb the ladder at F-6. Follow the path, and when you reach a **T** intersection, turn right.
:* Map 2: From this point, go to M-8 and climb the ladder.
:** To get there you'll need to __open the Iron Gate at J-6__ with a {@i:Bronze Key|1660} {i:Bronze Key|Bronze Key|1660} or use a Thief to pick the lock, bring several {@i:Thief's Tools|1022} {i:Thief's Tools|Thief's Tools|1022} as it usually takes more than one try.
:* Map 3: Take the south corridor. Check the ??? at the north-east corner of (J-9) (behind the laddder against the bookcase) to open the secret door to the hidden hallway which heads to the north.
:* Hidden Hallway: Check the 2nd __Ornate Gate__ at (K-8) for a cutscene.

* Return to {n:Odeya} for the next cutscene and your reward.

